<para id="RM0000020V2009X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="065BJ-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020V2009X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020V2009X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00002XI00000">
<ptxt>Inspect E.F.I. Water Temperature Sensor</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A050330J03" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Approx. 20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2.30 to 2.60kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Approx. 80°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.310 to 0.326kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>When inspecting the sensor by immersing it in water, be careful not to allow water to enter the terminals. After the inspection, wipe off any water droplets on the sensor.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s3>
</s2>
